<title>FRANCE: French cocoa bean imports rose in July on year-ago.</title>
<headline>French cocoa bean imports rose in July on year-ago.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French July cocoa bean imports issued by French customs included. (in tonnes).</p>
<p>		  July 96   July 95   Jan/July 96    Jan/July 95</p>
<p>Ivory Coast    1,996    5,603     41,928	   42,002</p>
<p>Ghana	    1,660	730     10,001	    8,786</p>
<p>Nigeria	    370	931	7,325	    2,107</p>
<p>Cameroun	   256	906	6,488	    5,734</p>
<p>Indonesia	  316	371	6,648	    6,970</p>
<p>World total    5,529   10,365     76,737	   70,740</p>
</text>
